Smart Medication Reminder Demonstration

This video demonstrates my Arduino-based medication reminder system working at a scheduled time. Using a real-time clock (RTC) module, the Arduino Uno activates a buzzer and LED to remind the user to take their medication. When the user presses a button, the alarm stops, and a servo motor opens the medication compartment before automatically closing it.

